WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:15.210
Daisy: Oh no. A substitute teacher!

2
00:00:15.211 --> 00:00:19.046
Mark: Where's Miss Gray?

3
00:00:19.047 --> 00:00:22.146
Coby: Will she be back soon?

4
00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:27.154
Mrs. Dee: Miss Gray broke her ankle.

5
00:00:27.155 --> 00:00:31.214
Mrs. Dee: So she'll be out of school for one week.

6
00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:37.314
Class: Oh no!

7
00:00:37.315 --> 00:00:41.807
Kara: Too bad about those flowers for Miss Gray, Daisy.

8
00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.550
Jenna: Don't worry.

9
00:00:43.551 --> 00:00:48.882
You can give them to her next week.

10
00:00:48.883 --> 00:00:53.193
Eve: I miss our teacher so much!

11
00:00:53.194 --> 00:00:56.172
Maya: Me too.

12
00:00:56.173 --> 00:00:59.480
Coby: School hasn't even started yet today!

13
00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:07.472
Maya: But it feels like Miss Gray has been gone forever.

14
00:01:07.473 --> 00:01:11.266
Mrs. Dee: Please tell me your names, class.

15
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.790
Greg: My name is Juan.

16
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.087
Juan: My name is Greg.

17
00:01:16.088 --> 00:01:19.385
Kara: My name is Jenna.

18
00:01:19.386 --> 00:01:22.705
Daisy: That's not funny.

19
00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:26.585
Mrs. Dee, those aren't their real names.

20
00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:29.798
Greg: Okay. My name is Jenna.

21
00:01:29.799 --> 00:01:32.873
And he's Daisy!

22
00:01:32.874 --> 00:01:40.186
Mrs. Dee: Your real names now, please.

23
00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:42.488
Mrs. Dee: Time for art class.

24
00:01:42.489 --> 00:01:49.978
Please line up at the door.

25
00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:54.408
Mrs. Dee: Hmm . . . Which way is the art room?

26
00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:59.311
Kids: That way! This way! Over there!

27
00:01:59.312 --> 00:02:02.415
Daisy: I can lead the way, Mrs. Dee.

28
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:04.434
Mrs. Dee: Thank you, Daisy.

29
00:02:04.435 --> 00:02:12.815
That would be a big help.

30
00:02:12.816 --> 00:02:16.614
Mrs. Dee: Please put away your books, boys and girls.

31
00:02:16.615 --> 00:02:23.276
Mrs. Dee: It's time for our math lesson.

32
00:02:23.277 --> 00:02:36.430
Boys! Girls! Right now!

33
00:02:36.431 --> 00:02:40.268
Miss Gray: I hope my class showed you their best manners today.

34
00:02:40.269 --> 00:02:42.239
Miss Gray: Did you have any problems?

35
00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:48.818
Mrs. Dee: Well, I would like to tell you about one student . . .
